#                the case runs on. True for every fixture case below: the
#                fixture corpus is 21 known files (benchmark/fixtures.py), so
#                the ground truth is checkable by reading it.
#   needs_review a plausible query shape, NOT yet confirmed against the real
#                Box index. Production cases below are all needs_review and
#                exist to define the SHAPE of the dataset that has to be
#                collected from real users. acceptance_verdict() reports
#                INCONCLUSIVE while any of these are present, so they can never
#                produce a false GO.
#
# IMPORTANT: fixture runs use a FAKE embedding model. They prove the harness and
# the pipeline mechanics; they say nothing about real retrieval quality. Only a
# production run over verified cases can certify anything.
#
# Categories: DOCUMENT_LOOKUP | TECHNICAL_INFO | CONTRACT_VERIFICATION
